OL,3,ASnapchat 'willing to implement' daily
OL,4,Atime limits for teens, boss tells BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe boss of Snapchat says the firm
OL,7,Fwould be "willing to implement" time
OL,8,Flimits for teens, following a call from
OL,9,FMeta for it to take action.
OL,11,FEvan Spiegel told the BBC in an
OL,12,Finterview at the company's California
OL,13,Fheadquarters that he believed setting a
OL,14,Fmaximum amount of time that young users
OL,15,Fcould spend on the app could be "an
OL,16,Fimportant step forward for the
OL,17,Findustry."
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
