OL,3,ABritish-American author and critic
OL,4,ABonnie Greer dies aged 77
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritish-American author and cultural
OL,7,Fcommentator Bonnie Greer has died at
OL,8,Fthe age of 77 after a brief illness,
OL,9,Fher husband has said.
OL,11,FIn a statement delivered with "profound
OL,12,Fsadness", Greer's widower David
OL,13,FHutchins noted how the acclaimed
OL,14,Fplaywright and critic had made "an
OL,15,Fenduring contribution to British
OL,16,Fcultural and public life" with her
OL,17,F"intelligence, courage and distinctive
OL,18,Fvoice".
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11915
SC,0015
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1789607903
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABritish-American author and critic
OL,4,ABonnie Greer dies aged 77
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe added: "To me, she was my partner,
OL,7,Fconfidante and inspiration, and I feel
OL,8,Fprofoundly privileged to have shared my
OL,9,Flife with her."
OL,11,FHutchins continued: "Those closest to
OL,12,FBonnie will remember her warmth,
OL,13,Fhumour, generosity and extraordinary
OL,14,Fability to bring people together."
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
